{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"id\":\"N113\",\"lines\":\"r-rn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N113.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The spring is heard as both a water source and a hollow. The horse’s paired hollows give عَيْنٍ a second, recess-like shape.\",\"reason\":\"The rare غرابان نقرتان are two pits, while عَيْنٍ can name an eye or spring aperture; their hollow shapes meet.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N113.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"after\":\"The title’s paired identity carries a sense of things joined. The rare image of a tightly bound knot makes that joining more tangible.\",\"reason\":\"The item’s العقد is a tight binding, and ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ is glossed as joining and binding one thing to another.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N113.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"Taking something for oneself faintly evokes fastening it in one’s grasp.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عقد means a tight binding, while تَتَّخِذَ means adopting or acquiring; the link is a general image of holding.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N114\",\"lines\":\"nrr--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N114.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَغْرُبُ\",\"after\":\"The setting horizon faintly evokes the white-edged image in المغرب.\",\"reason\":\"The rare المغرب is white in the lashes or hair, while تَغْرُبُ names sunset; the visual overlay is suggestive but thin.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N114.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The eye at the spring carries a precise detail: its lashes can be heard as whitened. The rare image brings the visible rim of the eye into the scene.\",\"reason\":\"The rare المغرب is described as الأبيض الأشفار, white-lashed, and عَيْنٍ names an eye; lashes are part of the eye.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N114.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"حَمِئَةٍ\",\"after\":\"The muddy spring is dark, while the rare image of المغرب is white-lashed. The color contrast sharpens the blackness of the water.\",\"reason\":\"المغرب is glossed as بياض الأشفار, whiteness of the lashes, whereas حَمِئَةٍ names black mud in water.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N115\",\"lines\":\"nr-rr-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N115.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"بَلَغَ\",\"after\":\"The arrow from an unknown source gives reaching the endpoint a faint image of arrival from nowhere.\",\"reason\":\"سهم غرب is an arrow whose shooter is unknown, while بَلَغَ means reaching a limit; the connection is the arrow’s arrival.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N115.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"after\":\"The traveler’s finding can carry the feel of an unexpected encounter. What he comes upon arrives as suddenly as the stray arrow.\",\"reason\":\"سهم غرب strikes from an unknown source, and وَجَدَهَا means finding or encountering; both present an unforeseen arrival.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N115.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The eye is not only a spring in this layered scene; it is the organ behind a gaze. The rare image adds the possibility of looking without aim.\",\"reason\":\"The source phrase نظر غرب ليس بقاصد describes an unfocused gaze, and عَيْنٍ can mean the eye that sees.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N115.5\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"The second finding also becomes an encounter with what arrives unexpectedly. The unknown arrow’s suddenness colors the people’s appearance at the spring.\",\"reason\":\"The rare سهم غرب is an arrow of unknown origin, and وَوَجَدَ means to find or encounter; each sense centers on an unanticipated meeting.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N116\",\"lines\":\"-r-r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N116.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَغْرُبُ\",\"after\":\"The setting sun can be pictured beside عنقاء مغرب, the far-flying bird. Its flight extends the western horizon into a scene of distance.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عنقاء مغرب is described as a bird that flies far, while تَغْرُبُ names the sun’s setting; together they make a horizon image.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N116.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"after\":\"Punishment becomes an oncoming calamity for the people. The rare image gives the punitive choice the scale of a great misfortune.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عنقاء مغرب can name a داهية, a great calamity, while تُعَذِّبَ is punitive suffering; punishment can be heard as the calamity arriving.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N117\",\"lines\":\"rr--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N117.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"after\":\"The sun strikes the rare غرب tree with its heat. The tree’s name brings the sun’s force into the material scene.\",\"reason\":\"The غرب is described as a tree تصيبه الشمس بحرها, struck by the sun’s heat, and ٱلشَّمْسِ names that sun.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N117.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَغْرُبُ\",\"after\":\"The setting is the moment when the rare غرب tree is heated by the sun. The dictionary image places that tree directly in the sunset scene.\",\"reason\":\"The source says الغربي شجر تصيبه الشمس بحرها عند الأفول, a tree struck by the sun’s heat at setting, alongside تَغْرُبُ.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N118\",\"lines\":\"n--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N118.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"Wine can be heard as a drink beside the spring’s water.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الغرب includes الخمر, wine, while عَيْنٍ can mean a flowing water source; the relation between two drinks is real but general.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N119\",\"lines\":\"r-rn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N119.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"بَلَغَ\",\"after\":\"Reaching a limit can be heard as reaching the height of an ache. The arrival frame gives the rare pain an endpoint of intensity.\",\"reason\":\"The rare أَغْرَبَ means that a man’s pain became severe, while بَلَغَ means to reach an end; the pain’s severity is a degree one reaches.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N119.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"after\":\"The punitive branch makes the rare pain sense audible. Punishment is experienced as severe bodily suffering.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الغرب names وجعًا وداءً, bodily pain or illness, and تُعَذِّبَ means inflicting pain and punishment.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N119.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"Acquiring a state faintly evokes an illness taking hold in the body.\",\"reason\":\"The rare sense is pain or disease, while the hint’s phrase حال تأخذ في الجسم describes a state that takes hold; the link is a thin image.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N120\",\"lines\":\"nn-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N120.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"after\":\"A precious silver or gold vessel can glint in sunlight.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الغرب is a valuable vessel of gold or silver, while ٱلشَّمْسِ is the sun; their meeting is a general image of reflected light.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N120.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The silver vessel can receive water from the spring.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الغرب is an إناء, a vessel, and عَيْنٍ can mean a water source; container and source complement one another.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N121\",\"lines\":\"nr-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N121.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"The sun’s setting faintly contrasts with a creature that cannot settle. Its retreat gives the restive image a point of departure.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الشموس is a restless creature that does not settle, while مَغْرِبَ is the sun’s setting place; restlessness and setting pull in different directions.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N121.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَغْرُبُ\",\"after\":\"The setting sun can be heard as a restless creature still in motion. It disappears without ever seeming to settle.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الشموس describes a creature that لا يكاد يستقر, scarcely settles, and تَغْرُبُ depicts the sun moving out of sight.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N121.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"Defiance meets a difficult, resistant temperament. The people near the scene can be heard against a spirit that refuses to yield.\",\"reason\":\"A رجل شموس is صعب الخلق, difficult in character, and عِندَهَا is glossed as resisting truth and crossing bounds.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122\",\"lines\":\"-n-nrnrr\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"after\":\"The encounter is faintly colored by hostility that has been openly shown.\",\"reason\":\"The rare شمس لي فلان means that someone displayed enmity, while وَجَدَهَا means finding or encountering; the encounter can disclose that hostility.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"The second finding brings the human encounter into view as a possible scene of expressed hostility.\",\"reason\":\"The rare sense is openly displaying enmity, while وَوَجَدَ is a social encounter here; one can meet people whose hostility is already visible.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122.5\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"The rare image of declared enmity echoes the resistance in عِندَهَا. Both senses turn toward opposition rather than agreement.\",\"reason\":\"شمس لي فلان means showing someone one’s enmity, and عِندَهَا is glossed as resisting truth and turning aside from the straight course.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122.6\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"Speech can be one way to make hostility visible.\",\"reason\":\"The rare شمس means openly displaying enmity, while قُلْنَا is putting speech into words; utterance can carry such a display.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122.7\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"after\":\"The rare sense gives the punitive option a hostile face. The expressed enmity stands just before its harmful act.\",\"reason\":\"The rare شمس is to display enmity كأنه قد هم أن يفعل, as though about to act, and تُعَذِّبَ names the punitive action that can follow.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N122.8\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"The choice between hostility and goodness becomes stark. Open enmity stands against doing good to the people.\",\"reason\":\"The rare شمس means openly showing عداوة, enmity, while حُسْنًا names goodness and acting well toward others.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N123\",\"lines\":\"nnn-r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N123.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"The sun at its setting faintly resembles a pendant hanging low on a horizon.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الشمس is a necklace pendant, while مَغْرِبَ is the sun’s setting place; the hanging image is visual but thin.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N123.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَغْرُبُ\",\"after\":\"The setting sun can be pictured as a pendant hanging toward the horizon.\",\"reason\":\"The rare شموس is a necklace pendant, and تَغْرُبُ is the sun descending from view; the two make a faint hanging image.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N123.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The hanging pendant is faintly set against the spring’s flow.\",\"reason\":\"The rare معاليق القلائد are hanging ornaments, while عَيْنٍ can mean flowing water; suspension and flow contrast, though generally.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N123.5\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"after\":\"The dual title evokes things joined together. A necklace does the same through its linked ornaments.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الشمس is a type of necklace, whose pieces attach to one another, and ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ is glossed as joining and binding things.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N124\",\"lines\":\"-rn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N124.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The encountered people can be heard as a congregation with a religious leader among them. The rare cleric sense adds a social role to the collective.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الشماس is a Christian religious leader, while قَوْمًا names a human collective; the leader belongs within a community.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N124.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"The rare cleric image faintly evokes an authority whose role includes speaking.\",\"reason\":\"A الشماس is a Christian leader, and قُلْنَا is authoritative speech; the association is a general one between religious office and utterance.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N125\",\"lines\":\"-r-nr\"}\n{\"id\":\"N125.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The people appear as a group that can be guarded and defended. The rare protective sense supplies a figure who stands for them.\",\"reason\":\"The rare المتشمس is one who يمنع ما وراء ظهره and is شديد القومية, protective of his people, while قَوْمًا names the collective he protects.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N125.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"Acquiring something can faintly evoke holding it back for oneself.\",\"reason\":\"The rare شمس includes withholding and stinginess, while تَتَّخِذَ means adopting or acquiring; keeping what one takes is a thin image.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N125.5\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"The protective withholding sense stands against the offered goodness. The second branch opens generosity where the rare sense holds back.\",\"reason\":\"The rare متشمس can mean بخيل, stingy, while حُسْنًا is doing good and showing kindness; stinginess opposes generosity.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N126\",\"lines\":\"--rr--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N126.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The spring can be heard as the named source Shams. The rare place-name turns the open-ended عين into a specific water source.\",\"reason\":\"The rare phrase شمس عين ماء معروفة names a known spring, while عَيْنٍ can mean a spring or source of flowing water.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N126.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"target_ar\":\"حَمِئَةٍ\",\"after\":\"The rare named spring can be pictured with the mud that darkens this water. The name Shams becomes part of the scene of a muddy source.\",\"reason\":\"The item includes شمس عين ماء معروفة, a known spring, and حَمِئَةٍ describes black mud in water; together they evoke a muddy spring.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N127\",\"lines\":\"n-r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N127.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"بَلَغَ\",\"after\":\"Reaching an endpoint can faintly evoke attaining a position of greatness.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جد means greatness or high rank, while بَلَغَ means reaching a limit; greatness can be a status one reaches.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N127.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"sound\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"The repeated finding carries a small sound echo of majesty. The second encounter can thus hold an undertone of greatness.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جدّ means grandeur, and وَوَجَدَ means finding; their consonants echo without sharing a root, and finding can encounter something majestic.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N128\",\"lines\":\"--rrn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N128.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"The second finding can open onto the discovery of good fortune. The encountered people become the setting for a share of worldly abundance.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجد is الحظ والغنى, fortune and wealth, while وَوَجَدَ means finding; finding can bring a person upon their fortune.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N128.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"The act of taking can turn a fortunate share into something possessed. Acquisition becomes the step by which wealth is held.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجد is good fortune and wealth, while تَتَّخِذَ means acquiring or adopting; acquisition is a means of possessing that fortune.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N128.5\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"Good fortune and goodness share a broad sense of positive value.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجد is a favorable worldly lot, while حُسْنًا is moral goodness or excellence; their shared positive evaluation is generic.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N129\",\"lines\":\"r--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N129.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"The sun’s setting can be heard as the day being cut off. The rare severing image gives the western limit a sharper sense of ending.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جدّ means cutting or severing, while مَغْرِبَ is the setting place; sunset visually closes off the day.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N130\",\"lines\":\"rn-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N130.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"after\":\"The setting sun belongs to a cycle of renewal. Each disappearance makes room for another new day.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جديد means new, and الجديدان names night and day; ٱلشَّمْسِ sets within that recurring day-and-night renewal.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N130.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"A new thing can be what the second finding brings into view.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جدّة is newness, while وَوَجَدَ means encountering or finding; the discovery of something new is a real but common link.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N131\",\"lines\":\"-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N131.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"The clear road contrasts with the turning away from what is straight. The rare path sense makes the deviation in عِندَهَا especially visible.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجادة is a clear, straight road, while عِندَهَا is glossed as turning aside from the straight course and resisting truth.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132\",\"lines\":\"rrrn-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"The western setting is an edge of the sun’s path. The rare riverbank makes that endpoint echo the edge of a body of water.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجدة is the ساحل or حافة of a river, while مَغْرِبَ marks the sunset’s limit; each gives an image of an edge.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The spring can be heard with its bank beside it. The rare river-edge sense supplies the boundary of the water source.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جدة النهر is the river’s edge, while عَيْنٍ can mean a spring; the bank is part of the spring’s waterside setting.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"حَمِئَةٍ\",\"after\":\"The muddy spring can be pictured at a water’s edge. The rare bank sense gives the dark water a shoreline.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجدة is a riverbank or shore, and حَمِئَةٍ names dark mud in water; together they make a muddy waterside image.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"The act of finding faintly complements the discovery of a riverbank.\",\"reason\":\"The rare جدة is a riverbank, while وَوَجَدَ means to find or encounter; one can find such an edge, though the link is general.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N133\",\"lines\":\"-rn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N133.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"The level ground opposes the turning aside from a straight course. The rare landscape image makes the moral deviation more concrete.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجدد is flat, even ground, while عِندَهَا is glossed as deviation from straightness and resistance to truth.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N133.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"A smooth, even surface can faintly appear as a pleasing form of goodness.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الجدد is a level, hard surface, while حُسْنًا names beauty or goodness; their physical and evaluative senses only loosely meet.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N134\",\"lin